WEBVTT

00:00.140 --> 00:03.660
Self reported , probably about 75% of

00:03.660 --> 00:06.290
service members take one or more

00:06.290 --> 00:08.680
dietary supplements at least once a

00:08.680 --> 00:11.120
week . Unfortunately , we do have

00:11.130 --> 00:14.340
documented cases of adverse events and

00:14.340 --> 00:16.507
also a positive drug test , so we want

00:16.507 --> 00:19.330
to make sure our service members remain

00:19.330 --> 00:22.750
healthy , of course , and safe . The

00:22.760 --> 00:25.020
truisms is if if it's a weight loss

00:25.020 --> 00:27.242
supplement and it works , it's probably

00:27.242 --> 00:27.840
a drug .

